---
// About Triverse — simplified, clean section
---

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-container">
    <span class="about-label">ABOUT</span>
    <h2 class="about-title">ABOUT <span class="accent">TRIVERSE</span></h2>
    <p class="about-body">
      Triverse is a high-intensity two-day tech event where thinking matters more than building.
      Across three distinct formats — Bet for Tech, Typothon, and The Drop — participants break
      real products, launch absurd-yet-believable future technology, and compete in strategy-driven
      battles that reward judgment, risk-taking, and psychological play. No templates, no rote hacks,
      no safe answers. Ship nothing — prove everything.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: 120px 24px;
    background-color: #050505;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-sf-pro), -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: #ec4899;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 0.9;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards 0.1s;
  }

  .accent {
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .about-body {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    line-height: 1.85;
    font-weight: 300;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards 0.3s;
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-section { padding: 72px 20px; }
    .about-body { font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-section { padding: 60px 18px; }
    .about-title { letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
    .about-body { font-size: 0.93rem; }
  }
</style>
